1. What is "conditional rendering"?
   Choosing things to render based on conditions, ie. "render only if X is true" or "render only if X and Y are above Z value"


2. When would you use &&?
   When you want to either display something or NOT display something


3. When would you use a ternary?
   When you need to decide which of 2 things to display


4. What if you need to decide between > 2 options on
   what to display?

   if...else statement or a function